§ `s 5`

#ASSERT `the Corporation is sole trustee of` `the 1879 indenture`
#ASSERT `the Corporation is sole trustee of` `the 1892 Statutory Land Grant`
#ASSERT NOT `the Corporation is sole trustee of` `some other trust instrument`

#ASSERT NOT `a new trustee may be appointed under the instrument's own power` `the 1892 Statutory Land Grant`

